   "text": "Info line (engine text): A sourcing rule tells where a region's units of an MK are built. Order: planner override and alias pin, routing group, this rule,\nITEM x PLANT default shares, UNASSIGNED (CP-07). A plant outside the rule is accepted and flagged; nothing is rejected except an invalid save.",
